      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5799 - The Prophet (sw) said; \"What disease is more severe than miserliness?\"\n5800\n5800 - اَلْحَيَاءُ خَيْرٌ كُلُّهُ\".\nHadith.5800 - The Prophet (sw) said; \"Modesty is entirely good.\" (in its wellness and virtue)\n5801\n5801 - اَلْيَمِينُ اَلْفَاجِرَةُ تَذَرُ اَلدِّيَارَ مِنْ أَهْلِهَا بَلاَقِعَ\".\nHadith.5801 - The Prophet (sw) said; \"A false oath leaves homes desolate of their inhabitants.\""
        ]
      }
